# Circuit shape of `div` for each operand mode and a fixed set of field elements.
# Line: <type.mode of each operand> | <value of each constant operand, _ for a variable one, or *> : <result>
# A `_` stands for each value of a variable operand. The test checks that they give one result.
# Result: constants public private constraints nonzeros(A/B/C) output-mode digest, or halt.
# The digest is the first 64 bits of a SHA-256 hash of the constraint structure: the order of the constraints, and the constant,
# coefficients and variables of each linear combination.
# A mixed output mode counts the constant, public and private bits.
# The test also checks each case with the console operation. A defined case must give the console
# value in a satisfied circuit. An undefined case must halt or leave the circuit unsatisfied.
# A `*` line gives the result of each case of its block that has no line of its own.
# Regenerate: UPDATE_CIRCUIT_SNAPSHOTS=1 cargo test -p snarkvm-circuit-types-field --test snapshots
field.constant field.constant | * : 1 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant e3b0c44298fc1c14
field.constant field.constant | 0 0 : halt
field.constant field.constant | 1 0 : halt
field.constant field.constant | 2 0 : halt
field.constant field.constant | (p-1)/2 0 : halt
field.constant field.constant | (p+1)/2 0 : halt
field.constant field.constant | -2 0 : halt
field.constant field.constant | -1 0 : halt
field.constant field.public | * : 0 0 1 1 1/1/1 private c180cfe9cfa47118
field.constant field.public | 0 _ : 0 0 1 1 1/1/1 constant c180cfe9cfa47118
field.constant field.private | * : 0 0 1 1 1/1/1 private 25d4e86b32944909
field.constant field.private | 0 _ : 0 0 1 1 1/1/1 constant 25d4e86b32944909
field.public field.constant | * : 1 0 0 0 0/0/0 private e3b0c44298fc1c14
field.public field.constant | _ 0 : halt
field.public field.constant | _ 1 : 1 0 0 0 0/0/0 public e3b0c44298fc1c14
field.public field.public | _ _ : 0 0 2 2 2/2/2 private cdbfefbd2c088870
field.public field.private | _ _ : 0 0 2 2 2/2/2 private a01aafa6f6e7c044
field.private field.constant | * : 1 0 0 0 0/0/0 private e3b0c44298fc1c14
field.private field.constant | _ 0 : halt
field.private field.public | _ _ : 0 0 2 2 2/2/2 private b2ee96ffacff32cb
field.private field.private | _ _ : 0 0 2 2 2/2/2 private 04e974a6ba678698
